0..76 Comment "// The twin of the model\'s `originOther`: an atom whose type member states a"
77..150 Comment "// relation and its reflexivity but no transport law. Without the law the"
151..226 Comment "// relation is no identity system (Univalent Foundations Program, _Homotopy"
227..305 Comment "// Type Theory_, 2013, §5.8, Theorem 5.8.2), so the atom\'s identity stays its"
306..371 Comment "// own and the relation\'s evidence is no path between its points."
373..447 Comment "// The relation, its reflexivity and its transport law over the unit type."
